: -10, "id": "27"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G5qVLPKSQUk/0.jpg", "preference": -9, "id": "28"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/G5qVLPKSQUk/0.webp", "preference": -8, "id": "29"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G5qVLPKSQUk/hqdefault.jpg", "preference": -7, "id": "30"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/G5qVLPKSQUk/hqdefault.webp", "preference": -6, "id": "31"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G5qVLPKSQUk/sddefault.jpg", "preference": -5, "id": "32"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/G5qVLPKSQUk/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "33"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G5qVLPKSQUk/hq720.jpg", "height": 720, "width": 1280, "preference": -3, "id": "34", "resolution": "1280x720"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/G5qVLPKSQUk/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "35"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G5qVLPKSQUk/maxresdefault.jpg", "preference": -1, "id": "36"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/G5qVLPKSQUk/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "37"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G5qVLPKSQUk/hq720.jpg", "description": "请观看我的频道更新消息。 \r\n订阅我：https://lihi.cc/jzQXz\r\n\r\n    隨著中餐廳第一集的播出的火熱之后，《中餐廳》第二季應運而生，趙薇依舊當作主廚，嘉賓有蘇有朋、舒淇、王俊凱、小百，然后會有不同的飛行嘉賓來參加。\r\n    吸取上一季的經驗，上一季中只有張亮做主廚，給累出了心肌炎。這一季，趙薇決定五個人輪流做主廚，來緩解勞累。\r\n    這一期的主廚是小白，卻來了八位神秘的客人，看起來穿的非常正式，而且要求很嚴格：要求把酒放到冰箱十八度冷藏，蘇有朋在給上酒的時候也是緊張了，不知道該怎么倒酒了，幸虧有趙店長細心提醒。\r\n    不止這些，菜品也出了問題，竟然慘遭客人退菜！\r\n    法國人確實不怎么吃辣，但是小白是四川人，做飯有放辣椒的習慣，慘遭退菜小白也是有點尷尬，說這魚再說辣我真的是沒有辦法了。\r\n    對于放不放辣椒，很多網友也展開了討論，很多人表示要根據客人的口味來做菜，很多人又說畢竟要宣傳中國菜，還是要有一定的地域特色！對此大家怎么看？", "channel_id": "UCZ0n5OhlDkEfRQEZWXLlhJQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZ0n5OhlDkEfRQEZWXLlhJQ", "duration": 74, "view_count": 43, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G5qVLPKSQUk", "tags": ["酒", "中餐厅", "苏有朋", "辣椒", "赵薇"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto